This license applies to the hardware design files of this project, including schematics, PCB layouts, design source files, and other original design materials published by the copyright holder.
1. Personal and non-commercial use
Permission is granted to individuals to download, study, modify, reproduce, and manufacture the design for personal, educational, and non-commercial research purposes.
Individuals may manufacture PCBs for their own use, including by using third-party PCB manufacturing services, provided that the boards are manufactured exclusively for their personal, non-commercial use.
2. Commercial use
Commercial use of this design requires prior written permission from the copyright holder.
Commercial use includes, but is not limited to:
- Manufacturing or commissioning the manufacture of the design for use in a commercial product.
- Incorporating the design, or a modified version of it, into a product intended for commercial distribution.
- Selling, licensing, or otherwise exploiting the design or derivative designs for commercial purposes.
- Using the design as part of a commercial service, product development activity, or other business activity.
This restriction applies to companies, organisations, and individuals acting on behalf of a commercial entity.
3. Contract manufacturing
Using a third-party manufacturer to produce boards for personal, non-commercial use is permitted under Section 1.
However, commissioning a manufacturer to produce boards for incorporation into a commercial product requires prior written permission from the copyright holder, even if the manufacturer does not own, sell, or distribute the finished product.
4. Modifications and derivative works
Individuals may modify the design for personal, non-commercial purposes.
Permission to use the original design does not automatically grant permission to use modified versions commercially. Commercial use of derivative designs incorporating copyright-protected material from this project also requires prior written permission, to the extent permitted by applicable law.
5. Redistribution
Individuals may share the original design files and their modifications for non-commercial purposes, provided that this license and the applicable copyright notices accompany the files.
Redistribution does not grant recipients any commercial rights.
6. Commercial licensing
Commercial licenses may be granted separately by the copyright holder.
The terms of such licenses, including permitted uses, manufacturing rights, distribution rights, and any applicable fees, must be agreed upon in writing before commercial use begins.
